If a court holds that one part of this license is unenforceable, the rest stays in effect. A failure to enforce a part is not a waiver.

This license is the entire agreement about the Enterprise Edition, together with the agreement when you have one. It replaces earlier oral terms and earlier written terms about that subject. A change to this license needs a writing signed by [LEGAL ENTITY NAME], except a newer version published under section 1.

A notice under this license is in writing. Delivery to the address in the agreement is notice. If there is no agreement, delivery to the contact published with the Enterprise Edition is notice.
